    {
      "id": "claim_a9771cb49f2b494ca10b247c4963631e",
      "statement": "The `deletedAt` tombstone is distinct from `status='stopped'`; every task-scoped read path adds `isNull(tasks.deletedAt)` to its WHERE clause (alongside `eq(tasks.userId, session.user.id)`), so a soft-deleted row returns 404 from every API while a `stopped` row remains fully visible and resumable through `POST /api/tasks/:taskId/continue`.",
