    {
      "id": "claim_e64274a6afcd4f23bc332446b1e48612",
      "statement": "`POST /api/tasks/:taskId/continue` rewinds any non-pending, non-deleted row to `status='processing'`, resets `progress=0`, clears `completedAt=NULL`, persists the new message into `taskMessages`, and then re-enters the worker pipeline (either reconnecting via `Sandbox.get(sandboxId)` when `task.keepAlive && task.sandboxId`, or building a fresh sandbox with `preDeterminedBranchName: branchName`).",
